      "summary": {
        "unit_id": "hmh07-lua-follow1:121",
        "answer": "Constructs the eliminated-score backing as ordered blur/dark/background layers, grids, striped accents, repeated plus marks, arrows and frame images. It attaches each image and retains the named field, queues state updates, optionally calls PostLoadFunc and returns self. No model producer or elimination decision is implemented by this visual constructor; those remain with stopped GameEndScore_WZ caller186 and opaque assets/rendering.",
        "unknowns": [
